{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-31","kind":"proposition","title":"半圆所对的圆周角是直角","englishTitle":"In a circle the angle in the semicircle is right, that in a greater segment less than a right angle, and that in a less segment greater than a right angle; and further the angle of the greater segment is greater than a right angle, and the angle of the less segment less than a right angle.","book":3,"number":31,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.31","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.31/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":31,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-31@raw-60c43fe7fd552ad3","contentId":"euclid-3-31","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"60c43fe7fd552ad3faabf2cb3f01acb386e69dd7da71af5b4b7d2e59bdf6601a","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-31.statement","euclid-3-31.construction.1","euclid-3-31.construction.2","euclid-3-31.proof.1","euclid-3-31.proof.2","euclid-3-31.proof.3","euclid-3-31.proof.4","euclid-3-31.proof.5","euclid-3-31.proof.6","euclid-3-31.proof.7","euclid-3-31.proof.8","euclid-3-31.proof.9","euclid-3-31.conclusion","euclid-3-31.historical.1","euclid-3-31.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-31.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-31","revisionId":"euclid-3-31@raw-60c43fe7fd552ad3","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cec7a0a8f37f88abf065fba6d196bb16f8e0890a4446f066d4e00778c42dd47a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In a circle the angle in the semicircle is right, that in a greater segment less than a right angle, and that in a less segment greater than a right angle; and further the angle of the greater segment is greater than a right angle, and the angle of the less segment less than a right angle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在同一个圆中，半圆所对的圆周角是直角；大于半圆的弓形所对的圆周角小于直角，小于半圆的弓形所对的圆周角大于直角。此外，大弓形的弓形角大于直角，小弓形的弓形角小于直角。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"负半圜角必直角负大分角小于直角负小分角大于直角大圜分角大于直角小圜分角小于直角"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"半圆所对的圆周角是直角；大于半圆的弓形所对的圆周角小于直角，小于半圆的弓形所对的圆周角大于直角。大弓形的弓形角大于直角，小弓形的弓形角小于直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-31.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-31","revisionId":"euclid-3-31@raw-60c43fe7fd552ad3","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2c457e02bf6693063b70aa9a92cf3ebf12d827de24b31f7fcd045435a8536411","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCD be a circle, let BC be its diameter, and E its centre, and let BA, AC, AD, DC be joined; I say that the angle BAC in the semicircle BAC is right, the angle ABC in the segment ABC greater than the semicircle is less than a right angle, and the angle ADC in the segment ADC less than the semicircle is greater than a right angle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"设 ABCD 为圆，BC 为其直径，E 为圆心，并连接 BA、AC、AD、DC。我断言：半圆 BAC 中的角 BAC 是直角；大于半圆的弓形 ABC 中的角 ABC 小于直角；小于半圆的弓形 ADC 中的角 ADC 大于直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-31.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-3-31","revisionId":"euclid-3-31@raw-60c43fe7fd552ad3","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4a77d09138e3bf0d38e155b5c287feda8097df49fb603c04df242d57f19a91f1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AE be joined, and let BA be carried through to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AE连接,让BA连接到F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-31.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-31","revisionId":"euclid-3-31@raw-60c43fe7fd552ad3","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bd355c206ca710f3502b81b602cfefb2cf8661cb9edb81df1f429dbe1aecaade","citations":["euclid-1-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since BE is equal to EA, the angle ABE is also equal to the angle BAE. [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"礛由于BE等于EA,角度ABE也等于角度BAE。 [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-31.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-31","revisionId":"euclid-3-31@raw-60c43fe7fd552ad3","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4e80ea71324626e7d42d3dceb7e435a6f3c2dad271819adbb29d4be5cc07a95f","citations":["euclid-1-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since CE is equal to EA, the angle ACE is also equal to the angle CAE. [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于CE等于EA,ACE角也等于CAE角。 [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-31.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-31","revisionId":"euclid-3-31@raw-60c43fe7fd552ad3","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c62cde43547b71c4194ea52f65f8d101730e661293844c93f42384ce0d578f4d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the whole angle BAC is equal to the two angles ABC, ACB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,整个角度BAC等于两个角度ABC,ACB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-31.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-3-31","revisionId":"euclid-3-31@raw-60c43fe7fd552ad3","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c4e52627644060df6ba5c76d395efb035f0dfafed98c6337a706a247e9956301","citations":["euclid-1-32","euclid-1-def-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle FAC exterior to the triangle ABC is also equal to the two angles ABC, ACB; [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] therefore the angle BAC is also equal to the angle FAC; therefore each is right; [[I. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-1-def-10)] therefore the angle BAC in the semicircle BAC is right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但三角形ABC的外角FAC也等于两个角ABC、ACB;因此,角BAC也等于角FAC;因此,每个角为直角;因此,BAC半圆形的角BAC是正确的。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] [[I. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-1-def-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-31.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-3-31","revisionId":"euclid-3-31@raw-60c43fe7fd552ad3","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"99161860b73772c7c0cee1b8b953e54cb5a61139444d51af6603779db37c6e96","citations":["euclid-1-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, since in the triangle ABC the two angles ABC, BAC are less than two right angles, [[I. 17](/principles/euclid-1-17)] and the angle BAC is a right angle, the angle ABC is less than a right angle; and it is the angle in the segment ABC greater than the semicircle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,在三角形ABC中,两个角度ABC,BAC小于两个直角,而BAC角为直角,ABC角小于直角;这是部分ABC的角大于半圆圈。 [[I. 17](/principles/euclid-1-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-31.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-3-31","revisionId":"euclid-3-31@raw-60c43fe7fd552ad3","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"89b6d81d98eba492e806e288adbb96f3c389fdabebb6bf63c3fc9e7df1f3c517","citations":["euclid-3-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, since ABCD is a quadrilateral in a circle, and the opposite angles of quadrilaterals in circles are equal to two right angles, [[III. 22](/principles/euclid-3-22)] while the angle ABC is less than a right angle, therefore the angle ADC which remains is greater than a right angle; and it is the angle in the segment ADC less than the semicircle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,由于ABCD是圆形中的四边形,圆形中四边形的相反角度等于2 直角,而ABC的角小于直角,因此,ADC的角大于直角;它是第ADC段的角,比半圆形小。 [[III. 22](/principles/euclid-3-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-31.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-3-31","revisionId":"euclid-3-31@raw-60c43fe7fd552ad3","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9eed05b21b7a52fec52fd0ba7308b64bd0fdb8054b616b172c439e161743ccc3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say further that the angle of the greater segment, namely that contained by the circumference ABC and the straight line AC, is greater than a right angle; and the angle of the less segment, namely that contained by the circumference ADC and the straight line AC, is less than a right angle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我进一步指出,较大的数量部分,即环形ABC和直线AC所形成的角度大于直角;较小的数量部分,即环形ADC和直线AC所形成的角度小于直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-31.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-3-31","revisionId":"euclid-3-31@raw-60c43fe7fd552ad3","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"46b776cfa79c0d82baa504cfb37d32b3b83cf67df2ed5a7457433717f929bd29","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"This is at once manifest. For, since the angle contained by the straight lines BA, AC is right, the angle contained by the circumference ABC and the straight line AC is greater than a right angle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"这是一次显示。 因为,由于直线BA,AC是正确, 环线ABC和直线AC所形成的角度大于直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-31.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-3-31","revisionId":"euclid-3-31@raw-60c43fe7fd552ad3","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d8d1c28be0409120fe67b2abfe1e333a750f744a161bcec880046d8b10210fb7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the angle contained by the straight lines AC, AF is right, the angle contained by the straight line CA and the circumference ADC is less than a right angle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于AC线AF线所形成的该角是直角,CA线和ADC环形所形成的角度不到直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-31.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-31","revisionId":"euclid-3-31@raw-60c43fe7fd552ad3","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-31.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-31","revisionId":"euclid-3-31@raw-60c43fe7fd552ad3","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"872a9ae7c84c9c4ca7c50de8f2140452a0cee213290f6d50dca3aef10e722365","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"负半圜角必直角负大分角小于直角负小分角大于直角大圜分角大于直角小圜分角小于直角解曰甲乙丙圜其心丁其径甲丙于半圜分内任作甲乙丙角形即甲乙丙角负甲乙丙半圜分乙甲丙角负乙甲丙大分又任作乙戊丙角负乙戊丙小分题先言负半圜之甲乙丙为直角二言负大分之乙甲丙角小于直角三言负小分之乙戊丙角大于直角四言丙乙甲大圜分角大于直角后言丙乙戊小圜分角小于直角先论曰试作乙丁线次以甲乙线引长之至已其丁乙丁甲两线等即丁乙甲丁甲乙两角等〈一卷五〉依显丁乙丙丁丙乙两角亦等而甲乙丙全角与乙甲丙甲丙乙两角并等又己乙丙外角亦与相对之乙甲丙甲丙乙两内角并等〈一卷卅二〉则己乙丙与甲乙丙等为直角二论曰甲乙丙角形之甲乙丙既为直角则乙甲丙小于直角〈一卷十七〉三论曰甲乙戊丙四边形在圜之内其乙甲丙乙戊丙相对两角并等两直角〈本篇廿二〉而乙甲丙小于直角则乙戊丙大于直角四论曰甲乙丙直角为丙乙甲大圜分角之分则大于直角后论曰丙乙戊小圜分角为己乙丙直角之分则小于直角此题别有四解四论先解曰甲乙丙半圜其心丁其上任作甲乙丙角题言此为直角论曰试作乙丁线其丁乙丁甲两线既等即丁乙甲丁甲乙两角亦等〈一卷五〉而乙丁丙外角既与丁乙甲丁甲乙相对之两内角并等〈一卷卅二〉即倍大于丁乙甲角依显乙丁甲外角亦倍大于丁乙丙角即乙丁甲乙丁丙两角并亦倍大于甲乙丙角夫乙丁甲乙丁丙并等两直角〈一卷十三〉则甲乙丙为直角二解曰甲乙丙大圜分其心丁任作甲乙丙角题言此小于直角论曰试作甲丁戊径线次作乙戊线相联其甲乙戊既为直角〈本题一论〉即甲乙丙为其分而小于直角三解曰甲乙丙小圜分其心丁任作甲乙丙角题言此大于直角论曰试作甲丁戊径线而引乙丙圜界至戊次作乙戊线其甲乙戊既负半圜之直角而为甲乙丙角之分则甲乙丙大于直角四五合解曰甲乙丙大圜分丙丁甲小圜分其心戊题言丙甲乙大圜分角大于直角丙甲丁小圜分角小于直角论曰试作乙戊丙径线次作乙甲线引长之至己其乙甲丙直角为丙甲乙大圜分角之分而丙甲丁小圜分角又为己甲丙直角之分则大分角大于直角小分角小于直角一系凡角形之内一角与两角并等其一角必直角何者其外角与内相对之两角等则与外角等之内交角岂非直角二系大分之角大于直角小分之角小于直角终无有角等于直角又从小过大从大过小非大即小终无相等依此题四五论甚明与本篇十六题増注互相发也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"半圆所对的圆周角是直角；大于半圆的弓形所对的圆周角小于直角，小于半圆的弓形所对的圆周角大于直角。设圆甲乙丙的圆心为丁，直径为甲丙；连接乙丁，并延长甲乙。由于丁乙、丁甲和丁丙都是半径，相关等腰三角形的底角分别相等〈一卷五〉；结合外角等于两个不相邻内角之和〈一卷卅二〉，得到半圆所对的角甲乙丙为直角。三角形另外两个内角因此都小于直角〈一卷十七〉。又因为圆内接四边形的对角之和等于两个直角〈本篇廿二〉，与锐角相对的圆周角必定大于直角。所以大弓形所对的圆周角是锐角，小弓形所对的圆周角是钝角；相应的大弓形角大于直角，小弓形角小于直角。古译接着从等腰三角形底角、直径作图与内接四边形分别给出其他证明，并指出：如果三角形一个内角等于另外两个内角之和，这个角必为直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-31.source","contentId":"euclid-3-31","revisionId":"euclid-3-31@raw-60c43fe7fd552ad3","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aa528877c5dceabba79ac543ffb86f6ddcbef59e894bf2fa3434068af3db55fc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.31/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.31\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-31:euclid-1-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-31","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-31.proof.1","euclid-3-31.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.31","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.31/","sourceLabel":"I. 5"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-31:euclid-1-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-31","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-31.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.31","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.31/","sourceLabel":"I. 32"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-31:euclid-1-def-10:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-31","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-31.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-def-10","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.31","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.31/","sourceLabel":"I. Def. 10"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-31:euclid-1-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-31","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-31.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.31","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.or